=== Text #1 ===
> Pads allow you to transition nicely from floor to pole. Slide on the floor, dragging[ your knees] without sticking to the floor. They[ cover] just enough of your knee to protect it without preventing you from gripping the pole.[]

=== Text #2 ===
> The design of the wine room was created utilizing a reclaimed door and wood from a barn located on the property. We were[ able] to use the reclaimed door's existing hardware to provide rustic charm and appeal. In addition the wood was used to create[ the] "X" pattern shelving with accent[ lighting] to provide[ warm] ambient light that enhances the overall look.[]

=== Text #3 ===
> Create a solid[ foundation] for your outfit with the Building Blocks Oval Gold Earrings! A texture gold metal oval shape. Earrings measure 1.5" long.
Long Hoop at the back.[]

=== Text #4 ===
> [The] fruit coasters are ornament and very colorful. They are great for cocktail parties.
Dimensions: 4.25" x 3.8" x 3.65"[]

=== Text #5 ===
> Nitrosamine free! Keep[ baby]'s teeth and gums clean and healthy.
Click the button below to add the Silicone Toothbrush to your wish list.[][]

=== Text #6 ===
> Beef Livestock record sheet, other forms needed, and beef project info. Click on the link and then click to open.
Level 1, Bite Into Beef – 4-Hers in Grades 3, 4, and 5.[][][][][][]

=== Text #7 ===
> [Access]ories for Breathalyzers alcohol breath testers.
You can obtain[ additional] mouthpieces[ for] your breathalyzer (alcohol breath tester, alcohol tester, personal breathalyzer[).] Sold in a package of 10 or 20 units depending on the type of device to ensure you have enough for your guests. The mouthpieces can be[ washed] in warm soapy water.[][][][][][][][][]

=== Text #8 ===
> [F]oil plaid lycra and spandex shortall with metallic slinky insets. Attached metallic elastic belt with O-ring. Headband included. Great hip hop or jazz dance costume. Made in the USA.[][]

=== Text #9 ===
> [This] dog brooch pin is made with polymer clay, painted, and sealed with varnish for protection. It is made[ and painted] by hand so each pin has[ some] variation and is unique in its own way!
The pin is 1.5" x 1.5" with rubber clutch backing and comes with a backing card.[][][][][][][]

=== Text #10 ===
> [All] black themes are always well liked by people. It is likely that you like it a lot too but if you find plain black themes so boring, you will probably like this theme with its[ green] streaks similar to leaves being[ sh]ined on with[ light]. The green colored icons fit well with the theme.[]

=== Text #11 ===
> [We] here in The Feed Zone Cookbook Test Kitchen are big fans of Biju’s Whole Roasted Chicken recipe. It’s super easy and just as tasty. We like it so much, we thought we’d share the recipe as a[ free] download.
It’s also one of the featured recipes on this Vel[o]News.com recipe series. Enjoy![][][][][][][][]

=== Text #12 ===
> [A] set of 12 fanciful and fun Shawl Pins. Each Shawl Pin comes with an organdy gift pouch. Direct your customers[ to] our video, which features creative ways to use the Shaune Bazner Shawl Pin![][][]

=== Text #13 ===
> [hd]00:11Red and gold Christmas balls on Christmas tree. A Christmas decoration. Background. New year. Winter holiday. Christmas background.
hd00:12Decorated Christmas tree on blurred, sparkling and fairy background.[][][][][][][][][][]

=== Text #14 ===
> [By] The Abyssinian | On May 13, 2015 | in Fun with Comments Off on Ethiopian food on The Simpsons!
Eat my Shiro! Check out the clip from The Simpsons! (23×5).[][][][][][][][]

=== Text #15 ===
> [Full] Bloom Vintage Moroccan Rug 4'6" x 7'4"
Bold, bright colors with a beautiful[ free] form design! The colors of this rug are hard to capture but are very vibrant. Has a playful electricity. Super soft, low pile shag.
Me[asures] approx: 4'6" x 7'4"[][][][][][][][]

=== Text #16 ===
> [The] Loudmouth Jeans. These mid rise, loose fit, dusty black jeans are a perfectly casual go-to. Features include all over distressing and an unfinished, frayed hem.[]

=== Text #17 ===
> [Simple] collegiate-style lettering is printed on a 3/4 sleeve shirt. Three fashionable buttons line the v-neck, giving the shirt a relaxed look.
Printed on an MV Sport shirt, it is 55% cotton and 45% polyester making this bi-blend have a[ soft] feel.[][][][][]

=== Text #18 ===
> [The] Fog Linen Apron will easily slip over your child's head and it will nicely drape into a criss-cross fit along the back. Perfect for play-time or dress up, a sizable front pocket hold tools for creativity or random items found on a stroll.
Generally fits kids 33" to 43" tall.
W 45cm x L 62cm | 18" x 24"[][][][][][]

=== Text #19 ===
> [Model] Home open daily 10am-4pm. Lot size 12,000 sq. ft. The 2245 plan offers fantastic single level living with a huge open concept great room & kitchen, 4 bedrooms and 2.5 baths. The kitchen includes slab quartz or granite counter-tops, under-mount sink, and shaker style cabinetry. The great room features a warm & cozy fireplace w/ eat-in nook.[][][][][][][][][][][][]

=== Text #20 ===
> [Nic]Quid Bahama Blizzard will rival any frozen tropical cocktail. Better than sitting on a beach with a breeze in your hair. It is a perfect paring of orange, cranberry and peach which is blended[ and frozen] with cool sweet menthol. NicQuip: The basic recipe for a Daiquirí is also similar to the grog British sailors were rationed aboard ship from the 1740s onwards. You may also have to ration NicQuid Bahama Blizzard before you vape it all up![][][][][][][]


